{{!--
  signature-frame (OVERVIEW.md section 15.2; parameters frozen): src, alt.
  The viewer's own signature on the thank-you page (F-46, ADR 0004 item 6): src is the private image route, never a
  data URL (CSP img-src 'self', F-71). alt is the text alternative ("Your signature"); the image is content, never
  decoration (F-84). Width and height are the fixed export size (720 x 240, ADR 0004 item 1), so the page reserves the
  3:1 space before the image loads and nothing shifts. The black-on-transparent PNG sits on a flat accent field, which
  keeps the ink visible in dark mode too (OVERVIEW.md section 15.4).
  Usage: {{> signature-frame src="/signature/image.png" alt="Your signature"}}
--}}
<div class="signature-frame">
  <img class="signature-frame__image" src="{{src}}" alt="{{alt}}" width="720" height="240">
</div>
